              246
            ],
            "conclusion": "`(2πt)²|f̂(t)| ≤ K` for all `t` gives `|Σ f(n)e(αn)| ≤ K/(4 sin²πα)` (the third term, `K = |\\widehat{f''}|_∞`)."
